GlyphAtlas integration and release interfaces, maintained by Luozheng Qin.

Based on Fr0zenCrane/dev-glyph-atlas at commit
3917d5b78b65e24afd022d2cd56fdb5833b8aeff.

The integration builds on AMAP-ML/FluxText (commit
d406544eed05a4a705693ff8e50b02382879fc79) and Hugging Face Diffusers.
Upstream code is obtained separately by tools/bootstrap_upstream.py and is
excluded from the source archive. Source hashes and attribution are retained.

FLUX, OCR weights, Arial fonts, datasets and experimental checkpoints are not
redistributed in this archive. Bundled fallback fonts retain their original
license files under assets/fonts. See docs/LICENSING.md.
